# A real R4 CGM-regime central forming stars as its own FoF central (call.p = call.centralgal): gas-
# unstable, its wind (host = central) ejects its cold gas and its CGM pair, and the yield's all-
# metals branch credits its (now empty) CGM metals; the observations that flip another galaxy's
# Regime are -1.
# R4 Snap_32 row 190
# (/Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R4/model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256
# 2b606ee7ac82559e32c7c91161f1edb44f89288ec57016e80da884e118ed0807)), ColdGas and MetalsColdGas
# raised x3.
# galaxy 0: R4 Snap_32 row 190 (GalaxyIndex 1000000107, Type 0, Regime 0)
# Reachability: R4-reachable.
# R4's flags (par/R4.par): CGMrecipeOn 1 (:54), FIREmodeOn 1 (:55), SFprescription 1 (:48),
# BulgeSizeOn 3 (:109), SupernovaRecipeOn 1 (:50), DiskInstabilityOn 1 (:52), AGNrecipeOn 2 (:49);
# every other parameter R3's (R4.par differs from R3.par only at :7 and :54).
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine starformation_and_feedback_fire

